<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70174" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεμεσίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 Verb, only pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feel righteous indignation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεῦ πάτερ, οὐ νεμεσίζῃ ὁρῶν τάδε
				καρτερὰ ἔργα</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.872
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.138
			</span></i>: c. dat. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥρῃ δ᾽ οὔ τι τόσον νεμεσίζομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.407
				</span></i>
			: c. dat. pers. et acc. rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ
				νεμεσίζῃ Ἄρῃ τάδε καρτερὰ ἔργα</span>; <i><span class="en">
				5.757
			</span></i>: c. acc. et inf., <i>to be angry</i> or
				<i>amazed</i> that . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ νεμεσίζομ᾽ Ἀχαιοὺς ἀσχαλάαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.296
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεμεσιζέσθω δ᾽ ἐνὶ θυμῷ Πάτ ροκλον .
					. μέλπηθρα γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.254
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stand in awe of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.263
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
